<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Fee Invoice Notification</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .header {
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 20px 0;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #777;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Fee Invoice Notification</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear {{parentName}},</p>

            <p>We hope this email finds you well. This is to notify you that the fee invoice for {{studentName}} for the
                month of {{invoiceMonth}} {{invoiceYear}} has been generated.</p>

            <p><strong>Total Amount Due: {{currency}}{{totalAmount}}</strong></p>

            <p>Please note that detailed information about the fee breakdown can be found in the attachment to this
                email.</p>

            <p>If you have any questions or concerns regarding the invoice, please don't hesitate to contact our
                accounts department.</p>

            <p>Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.</p>

            <p>Best regards,<br>
                {{schoolName}} Administration</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply directly to this message.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>